  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Marine Litter and Mindset Change in Mumbai</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The aim of the project is sustained improved clean environment on Mumbai beaches, river and mangroves, and citizens and decision makers aware of environmental hazards of plastic pollution as well as positive impact of circular economy. Mumbai results has proved potential to inspire other action on national and global level</narrative>
  </description>
